     Every exponent result for C > 1/D (Bu ¼, Sanders/JMTZ cyclic) must use finite binary structure, not weak
     second-order limits.
   - Third order: P62's gadget costs X^{7/15}. A PD gadget z_{jL} = v·σ(jL/X) (σ PD, L ~ v³) costs only v/2, but
