+## Scope and rules
+
+Read tdense15_brief.md, CLAUDE.md, and the number-theory-research skill. The round-specific rules govern: no subagents, no commits, no edits to the project-level .research markdown files, markdown mathematics only. All substantive computation will run through DIRICHLET_IP=34.148.157.169 src/dirun.sh -c 4, with Gurobi for optimization. This report and tdense15_scratch are the work products.
